{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-systems","title":"智能系统","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"智能系统-简介\">智能系统 简介</h1><p>智能系统是人工智能理论与工程实践的交汇领域，研究如何构建能够感知环境、学习知识和自主决策的计算系统。研究生阶段的智能系统学习要求在数学理论与实验实践之间建立紧密联系。</p>\n<p>本课程涵盖四个章节，从理论基础到系统构建再到安全保障，形成完整的知识链条。第一章<strong>机器学习理论基础</strong>从统计学习理论出发，深入讲解核方法和深度学习理论，帮助学习者理解机器学习模型的泛化能力、表达能力和优化行为的数学原理。第二章<strong>自然语言处理与计算机视觉</strong>聚焦当前人工智能最活跃的两个应用方向，系统介绍 Transformer 架构、大语言模型和视觉 Transformer 的设计原理与最新进展。第三章<strong>自主系统</strong>探讨强化学习进阶、多智能体系统和机器人学习三个方向，展示如何让智能体在复杂环境中通过交互来学习最优策略。第四章<strong>可信人工智能</strong>面对智能系统的社会化部署，讨论可解释人工智能、机器学习公平性和鲁棒机器学习等关键问题，为构建安全可靠的智能系统提供理论保障。</p>\n<p>建议学习者在理论学习之外积极参与实际项目和论文复现，智能系统领域的深入理解离不开动手实验。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ml-foundations","title":"机器学习理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/ml-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-learning-theory","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 统计学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/ml-foundations/statistical-learning-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kernel-methods","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 核方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/ml-foundations/kernel-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"deep-learning-theory","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 深度学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/ml-foundations/deep-learning-theory"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"nlp-cv","title":"自然语言处理与计算机视觉","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/nlp-cv","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"transformer-architecture","title":"研究生 智能系统 — Transformer 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/nlp-cv/transformer-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"large-language-models","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 大语言模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/nlp-cv/large-language-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vision-transformers","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 视觉 Transformer","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/nlp-cv/vision-transformers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"autonomous-systems","title":"自主系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/autonomous-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reinforcement-learning-grad","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 强化学习进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/autonomous-systems/reinforcement-learning-grad"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-agent-systems","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 多智能体系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/autonomous-systems/multi-agent-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"robot-learning","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 机器人学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/autonomous-systems/robot-learning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"trustworthy-ai","title":"可信人工智能","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/trustworthy-ai","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interpretable-ai","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 可解释人工智能","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/trustworthy-ai/interpretable-ai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fairness-in-ml","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 机器学习公平性","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/trustworthy-ai/fairness-in-ml"},{"seq":3,"slug":"robust-ml","title":"研究生 智能系统 — 鲁棒机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/engineering/intelligent-systems/trustworthy-ai/robust-ml"}]}]}